{c: Verse 1}
[C#] Aaye kuch abr kuchh,        [F#] sharaab aaye [C#]
[C#] Aaye kuch abr kuchh,        [F#] sharaab aaye [C#]
[C#] Is ke baad [G#] aaye jo,        [Fm] azaab [F#] aaye
[C#] Kar raha tha gham-e,        [Fm] jahaan ka [C#] hisaab
[C#] Aaj tum [G#] yaad,        [Fm] be-hisaab [F#] aaye [C#]
[C#] Is tarah apni,        [Fm] khaamoshi [C#] goonji
[C#] Goya har [G#] samt se,        [Fm] jawaab [F#] aaye [C#]
[C#] Baam-e meena se,        [Fm] maahataab [C#] utre
